--  The selected SysV, Darwin, standard AAPCS64, RISC-V LP64D or Cortex-M
--  AAPCS32 C scalar spelling layer. These are ordinary aliases, not distinct
--  scalar kinds: an extern(c) signature keeps the same Landin scalar identity
--  that its C spelling names.
--
--  c_char is the selected ABI's plain char, a numeric byte and never Landin's
--  Unicode scalar u32: signed i8 under SysV and Apple's arm64 ABI, and
--  unsigned u8 under standard AAPCS64, RISC-V LP64D and AAPCS32.
--
--  Four ABIs are LP64, whose long is 64 bits. AAPCS32 is ILP32 (D921): int,
--  long, size_t and pointers are all 32 bits, and long long 64.

--  landin/compiler is implicit. The ABI fact, not pointer width or
--  architecture alone, keeps the aliases from crossing data models.
compiler.assert(compiler.c_sysv_lp64 or compiler.c_darwin_lp64
                or compiler.c_aapcs64_lp64 or compiler.c_riscv_lp64d
                or compiler.c_aapcs32)

fixed if compiler.c_aapcs64_lp64 or compiler.c_riscv_lp64d
  or compiler.c_aapcs32 then
    --- The selected ABI's plain C char: unsigned under standard AAPCS64,
    --- RISC-V LP64D and AAPCS32, signed under SysV and Darwin LP64. A numeric
    --- byte, not a Unicode scalar.
    public c_char: type = u8
else
    --- The selected ABI's plain C char: unsigned under standard AAPCS64,
    --- RISC-V LP64D and AAPCS32, signed under SysV and Darwin LP64. A numeric
    --- byte, not a Unicode scalar.
    public c_char: type = i8
end if
--- Alias for C signed char under every supported ABI.
public c_schar: type = i8
--- Alias for C unsigned char under every supported ABI.
public c_uchar: type = u8
--- Alias for C signed short under every supported ABI.
public c_short: type = i16
--- Alias for C unsigned short under every supported ABI.
public c_ushort: type = u16
--- Alias for C signed int under every supported ABI.
public c_int: type = i32
--- Alias for C unsigned int under every supported ABI.
public c_uint: type = u32
fixed if compiler.c_aapcs32 then
    --- Alias for C signed long: 32 bits under AAPCS32's ILP32, 64 under
    --- the LP64 ABIs.
    public c_long: type = i32
    --- Alias for C unsigned long: 32 bits under AAPCS32's ILP32, 64 under
    --- the LP64 ABIs.
    public c_ulong: type = u32
else
    --- Alias for C signed long: 32 bits under AAPCS32's ILP32, 64 under
    --- the LP64 ABIs.
    public c_long: type = i64
    --- Alias for C unsigned long: 32 bits under AAPCS32's ILP32, 64 under
    --- the LP64 ABIs.
    public c_ulong: type = u64
end if
--- Alias for C signed long long under every supported ABI.
public c_longlong: type = i64
--- Alias for C unsigned long long under every supported ABI.
public c_ulonglong: type = u64
--- Alias for C size_t under every supported ABI: the target's usize, 32 bits
--- under AAPCS32.
public c_size: type = usize
--- Alias for C ptrdiff_t under every supported ABI: the target's isize, 32
--- bits under AAPCS32.
public c_ptrdiff: type = isize
--- Alias for C float under every supported ABI.
public c_float: type = f32
--- Alias for C double under every supported ABI.
public c_double: type = f64
--- Alias for C _Bool under every supported ABI.
public c_bool: type = bool
